<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="800" height="1200" viewBox="0 0 800 1200" role="img" aria-labelledby="title desc"><title id="title">CORE7 visual rules overview</title><desc id="desc">Minimal visual rules. Red beats Green, Green beats Blue, Blue beats Red, Gray blocks, loser discards one additional card, win three rounds, and Final Gray loses. Red is shown greater than Gray.</desc><image href="data:image/webp;base64," x="0" y="0" width="800" height="1200" preserveAspectRatio="none"/></svg>